[Article 2 of the Act on the Improvement of Urban Areas and Residential Environments (Definitions)] The meanings of terms used in this Act are as follows:

(1) "Maintenance area" means an area designated and publicly announced pursuant to Article 16 for the planned implementation of maintenance projects.
